a est ullamcorper eget nulla facilisi etiam facilisis dignissim diam quis enim lobortis scelerisque.</p><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit utsadi sfejdis aliquam, purus sit amet luctus venenatis, lectus magna sansit trandis fringilla urna, porttitor rhoncus dolor purus non enim dollors praesent tabasi elementum facilisis leo, vel fringilla est ullamcorper eget nulla facilisi etiam facilisis dignissim diam quis enim lobortis scelerisque iin fermentumisa dui faucibus in ornare.Lorem ipsum dolor sit.</p>		\n													<img width=\"1920\" height=\"551\" src=\"http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/project-dt-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/project-dt-1.jpeg 1920w, http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/project-dt-1-300x86.jpeg 300w, http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/project-dt-1-1024x294.jpeg 1024w, http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/project-dt-1-768x220.jpeg 768w, http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/project-dt-1-1536x441.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />													\n			<a href=\"#\">\n						Next Project\n					</a>\n			<style>\n@media only screen and (max-width: 1023px){\n    .text-image br{\n        display: none;\n    }\n}\n@media only screen and (max-width: 767px){\n    .text-image img{\n        width: 25px;\n}\n}\n</style>','Work Details','','publish','closed','closed','','work-details','','','2024-02-29 17:05:51','2024-02-29 17:05:51','',0,'http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/work-details/',0,'page','',0);
