color:#31a918}.elementor-social-icon-whatsapp{background-color:#25d366}.elementor-social-icon-wordpress{background-color:#21759b}.elementor-social-icon-xing{background-color:#026466}.elementor-social-icon-yelp{background-color:#af0606}.elementor-social-icon-youtube{background-color:#cd201f}.elementor-social-icon-500px{background-color:#0099e5}.elementor-shape-rounded .elementor-icon.elementor-social-icon{border-radius:10%}.elementor-shape-circle .elementor-icon.elementor-social-icon{border-radius:50%}</style>		\n					<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sardar-afaq-waheed-wordpress-developer-and-seo-specialist/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Linkedin\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 32H31.9C14.3 32 0 46.5 0 64.3v383.4C0 465.5 14.3 480 31.9 480H416c17.6 0 32-14.5 32-32.3V64.3c0-17.8-14.4-32.3-32-32.3zM135.4 416H69V202.2h66.5V416zm-33.2-243c-21.3 0-38.5-17.3-38.5-38.5S80.9 96 102.2 96c21.2 0 38.5 17.3 38.5 38.5 0 21.3-17.2 38.5-38.5 38.5zm282.1 243h-66.4V312c0-24.8-.5-56.7-34.5-56.7-34.6 0-39.9 27-39.9 54.9V416h-66.4V202.2h63.7v29.2h.9c8.9-16.8 30.6-34.5 62.9-34.5 67.2 0 79.7 44.3 79.7 101.9V416z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sardar_afaq_waheed?igsh=MmxvbWh5aDA0bTJu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Instagram\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1 37-2.1 147.9 0 184.9 1.7 35.9 9.9 67.7 36.2 93.9s58 34.4 93.9 36.2c37 2.1 147.9 2.1 184.9 0 35.9-1.7 67.7-9.9 93.9-36.2 26.2-26.2 34.4-58 36.2-93.9 2.1-37 2.1-147.8 0-184.8zM398.8 388c-7.8 19.6-22.9 34.7-42.6 42.6-29.5 11.7-99.5 9-132.1 9s-102.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sardarafaq.waheed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Icon-facebook\n											</a>\n			<a href=\"http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/contact/\">\n						Contact Me\n					</a>\n			<h2>ABOUT ME</h2>		\n		<p>I completed my Bachelor\'s in Computer Science from Abbottabad, Pakistan, from 2017 to 2021. I am passionate about learning and delivering good work. I have excellent communication skills and certificates in WordPress development and search engine optimization from Digi Skills.</p><p>I am working as a WordPress Developer at Dowell Research, Singapore. I use my skills to create websites and optimize them for search engines. My dedication and ability to learn help me excel in my work.</p>		\n			<h2>EXPERIENCE</h2>		\n			<h4>2022 - 2024 Present</h4>		\n			<h2>WordPress Developer</h2>		\n			<h4>Dowell Research Singapore</h4>		\n		<p>I am working as a WordPress Developer at Dowell Research in Singapore. My job involves creating and maintaining websites using WordPress, a popular platform for building websites. I focus on ensuring that the websites I develop are user-friendly, visually appealing, and optimized for search engines. I collaborate with a team of designers, content creators, and marketers to deliver high-quality websites that meet our clients\' needs.</p>		\n			<h4>2023 - 2024</h4>		\n			<h2>Search Engine Optimization</h2>		\n			<h4>Dowell Research Singapore</h4>		\n		<p>At Dowell Research in Singapore, I specialize in various aspects of SEO, including on-page, off-page, and technical SEO. In on-page SEO, I focus on optimizing website content, meta tags, and keyword placement to improve search engine rankings. Off-page SEO involves building backlinks and enhancing online presence through strategies like guest blogging and social media promotion. Additionally, I handle technical SEO tasks such as website speed optimization, mobile responsiveness, and fixing crawl errors to ensure the site performs well in search engine results. My expertise in these areas helps enhance the online visibility and performance of the websites I work on.</p>		\n			<h2>EDUCATION</h2>		\n			<h4>2017 - 2021</h4>		\n			<h2>Bachelor Degree in Computer Science</h2>		\n			<h4>Government Post Graduate College Abbottabad\n</h4>		\n		<p>Sit amet luctussd fav venenatis, lectus magna fringilla inis urna, porttitor rhoncus dolor purus non enim praesent in elementum sahas facilisis leo, vel fringilla est ullamcorper eget nulla facilisi etisam dignissim diam quis enim lobortis viverra orci sagittis eu volutpat odio facilisis mauris sit.</p>		\n			<h2>SKILLS</h2>		\n			<h2>WordPress</h2>		\n			<h2>92%</h2>		\n			<h2>HTML & CSS</h2>		\n			<h2>90%</h2>		\n			<h2>Elementor</h2>		\n			<h2>90%</h2>		\n			<h2>Woo Commerce</h2>		\n			<h2>85%</h2>		\n			<h2>SEO</h2>		\n			<h2>50%</h2>		\n			<h2>PHP</h2>		\n			<h2>Certification</h2>		\n			<h2>14 Feb 2024</h2>		\n			<h2>Digi Skills</h2>		\n			<p>WordPress Developer</p>		\n			<h2>14 Feb 2024</h2>		\n			<h2>Digi Skills</h2>		\n			<p>Search Engine Optimization</p>		\n			<style>\n    .credential-sidebar{\n        position: sticky;\n    top: 15%;\n    }\n    .bg-color{\n        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3C58E3 -15%, #C2EBFF 58%, #5AB5E2 97%);\n    }\n</style>','Credentials','','publish','closed','closed','','credentials','','','2024-02-29 20:03:46','2024-02-29 20:03:46','',0,'http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/credentials/',0,'page','',0);
