ilisis mauris sit.</p>		\n			<h2>EDUCATION</h2>		\n			<h4>2017 - 2021</h4>		\n			<h2>Bachelor Degree in Computer Science</h2>		\n			<h4>Government Post Graduate College Abbottabad\n</h4>		\n		<p>Sit amet luctussd fav venenatis, lectus magna fringilla inis urna, porttitor rhoncus dolor purus non enim praesent in elementum sahas facilisis leo, vel fringilla est ullamcorper eget nulla facilisi etisam dignissim diam quis enim lobortis viverra orci sagittis eu volutpat odio facilisis mauris sit.</p>		\n			<h2>SKILLS</h2>		\n			<h2>WordPress</h2>		\n			<h2>92%</h2>		\n			<h2>HTML & CSS</h2>		\n			<h2>90%</h2>		\n			<h2>Elementor</h2>		\n			<h2>90%</h2>		\n			<h2>Woo Commerce</h2>		\n			<h2>85%</h2>		\n			<h2>SEO</h2>		\n			<h2>50%</h2>		\n			<h2>PHP</h2>		\n			<h2>AWARDS</h2>		\n			<h2>14 May 2020</h2>		\n			<h2>Bluebase</h2>		\n			<p>Non enim praesent</p>		\n			<h2>26 June 2018</h2>		\n			<h2>Demble</h2>		\n			<p>Non enim praesent</p>		\n			<style>\n    .credential-sidebar{\n        position: sticky;\n    top: 15%;\n    }\n    .bg-color{\n        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3C58E3 -15%, #C2EBFF 58%, #5AB5E2 97%);\n    }\n</style>','Credentials','','inherit','closed','closed','','26-revision-v1','','','2024-02-29 20:03:45','2024-02-29 20:03:45','',26,'http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/?p=211',0,'revision','',0);
