h2>		\n			<h2>Client</h2>		\n			<h2>No client My Own Practice Project</h2>		\n			<h2>Services</h2>		\n			<h2>WordPress</h2>		\n			<h2>Project</h2>		\n			<h2>Dynamic</h2>		\n			<h2>Description</h2>		\n		<p>Discover our digital agency\'s website for sleek UI/UX designs. We specialize in SEO, marketing, business planning, web and cloud services, and reliable hosting. Elevate your online presence with us.</p>		\n			<h2>Website Development Tools and Techniques</h2>		\n		<ul><li>Elementor, Essential Addons for Elementor, Elementor Kit, and Met Form.</li><li>Seamless integration with the user-friendly Astra theme.</li><li>Enhance user experience with elegant design sections.</li><li>Incorporate animations to captivate visitors.</li><li>Add animated icons for visual appeal and engagement.</li></ul>		\n			<a href=\"https://afaqwaheed.github.io/digital-agency/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Visit Website\n					</a>\n			<style>\n@media only screen and (max-width: 1023px){\n    .text-image br{\n        display: none;\n    }\n}\n@media only screen and (max-width: 767px){\n    .text-image img{\n        width: 25px;\n}\n}\n</style>','Digital Agency','','inherit','closed','closed','','297-revision-v1','','','2024-03-06 15:17:42','2024-03-06 15:17:42','',297,'http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/?p=318',0,'revision','',0);
