/h2>		\n			<h2>WordPress</h2>		\n			<h2>Project</h2>		\n			<h2>Dynamic</h2>		\n			<h2>Description</h2>		\n		<p>Dowellstore\'s comprehensive documentation website, featuring APIs, libraries, WordPress plugins, and React packages. Explore easy-to-understand guides and resources for seamless integration and enhanced functionality.</p>		\n			<h2>Website Development Tools and Techniques</h2>		\n		<ul><li>Utilizes Elementor Pro for page building</li><li>Incorporates WPGetAPI for API testing</li><li>Implements W3 Total Cache for speed optimization</li><li>Ensures user-friendliness with Yoast and Rank Math plugins</li><li>Offers detailed documentation for easy reference</li><li>Optimizes keyword placement and images</li><li>Utilizes the Kadence theme for an elegant design</li><li>Includes a contact form for seamless communication</li></ul>		\n			<a href=\"https://afaqwaheed.github.io/ecommerce/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Visit Website\n					</a>\n			<style>\n@media only screen and (max-width: 1023px){\n    .text-image br{\n        display: none;\n    }\n}\n@media only screen and (max-width: 767px){\n    .text-image img{\n        width: 25px;\n}\n}\n</style>','E-Commerce','','inherit','closed','closed','','353-revision-v1','','','2024-04-14 06:10:16','2024-04-14 06:10:16','',353,'http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/?p=377',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (378,1,'2024-04-14 06:10:16','2024-04-14 06:10:16','<style>/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>E-Commerce</h2>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"1888\" height=\"838\" src=\"http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/E-Commerce-Works.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/E-Commerce-Works.png 1888w, http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/E-Commerce-Works-300x133.png 300w, http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/E-Commerce-Works-1024x455.png 1024w, http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/E-Commerce-Works-768x341.png 768w, http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/E-Commerce-Works-1536x682.png 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1888px) 100vw, 1888px\" />													\n													<img width=\"37\" height=\"97\" src=\"http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/icon3.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h2>Year</h2>		\n			<h2>2024</h2>		\n			<h2>Client</h2>		\n			<h2>N/A</h2>		\n			<h2>Services</h2>		\n			<h2>WordPress</h2>		\n			<h2>Project</h2>		\n			<h2>Dynamic</h2>		\n			<h2>Description</h2>		\n		<p>Project Description: This project entails creating a modern e-commerce store using WordPress, Elementor plugin, and WooCommerce plugin. The website showcases a range of electronic products including headphones, speakers, earbuds, and smartwatches.</p>		\n			<h2>WooCommerce Plugin Functionalities</h2>		\n		<ul><li>Product Pages: Customized layouts for each product category.</li><li>Shopping Cart Integration: Seamless integration with Elementor-designed pages.</li><li>Product Variation Options: Ability to select different colors, sizes, etc.</li><li>Payment Gateway Integration: Support for various payment methods.</li><li>Wishlist Feature: Allow users to save desired products for later purchase.</li><li>Product Filtering: Easy navigation through product categories.</li><li>Order Tracking: Provide customers with real-time updates on their orders.</li><li>Discount and Coupon Management: Implement promotional offers easily.</li><li>Related Products Section: Cross-selling and upselling opportunities.</li><li>Customer Reviews and Ratings: Enable feedback for products.</li><li>Inventory Management: Track stock levels and receive alerts for low inventory.</li><li>Responsive Design: Ensure compatibility with all devices for a smooth shopping experience.</li></ul>   <form>  </form>		\n			<a href=\"https://afaqwaheed.github.io/ecommerce/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Visit Website\n					</a>\n			<style>\n@media only screen and (max-width: 1023px){\n    .text-image br{\n        display: none;\n    }\n}\n@media only screen and (max-width: 767px){\n    .text-image img{\n        width: 25px;\n}\n}\n</style>','E-Commerce','','inherit','closed','closed','','353-revision-v1','','','2024-04-14 06:10:16','2024-04-14 06:10:16','',353,'http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/?p=378',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (379,1,'2024-04-14 06:10:51','2024-04-14 06:10:51','<style>/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>Dowell Data Cube</h2>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"1886\" height=\"838\" src=\"http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Dowell-Data-Cube-Works.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Dowell-Data-Cube-Works.png 1886w, http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Dowell-Data-Cube-Works-300x133.png 300w, http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Dowell-Data-Cube-Works-1024x455.png 1024w, http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Dowell-Data-Cube-Works-768x341.png 768w, http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Dowell-Data-Cube-Works-1536x682.png 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1886px) 100vw, 1886px\" />													\n													<img width=\"37\" height=\"97\" src=\"http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/icon3.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h2>Year</h2>		\n			<h2>2024</h2>		\n			<h2>Client</h2>		\n			<h2>Dowell Ux Living Lab</h2>		\n			<h2>Services</h2>		\n			<h2>WordPress</h2>		\n			<h2>Project</h2>		\n			<h2>Dynamic</h2>		\n			<h2>Description</h2>		\n		<p>Dowell Data Cube is a dynamic website showcasing the features of the Dowell DataCube and its API. Built on WordPress, the site utilizes the Elementor plugin to create a modern and visually appealing layout.</p>		\n			<h2>Elementor and Yoast</h2>		\n		<ul><li>Utilizes Elementor plugin in WordPress for modern website layout and design.</li><li>Elementor\'s drag-and-drop interface used to create visually appealing pages.</li><li>Implemented responsive design elements for optimal viewing on all devices.</li><li>Integrated custom widgets and elements for unique page layouts.</li><li>Utilized Elementor\'s theme builder for consistent branding across the site.</li><li>Employed advanced styling options for enhanced visual appeal.</li><li>Optimized website speed and performance through Elementor\'s optimization features.</li><li>Incorporated SEO-friendly page modules for better search engine visibility.</li><li>Utilized Elementor\'s dynamic content capabilities for automatic updates.</li><li>Implemented Elementor\'s form builder for user engagement and data collection</li></ul>		\n			<a href=\"https://www.samanta.tech/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Visit Website\n					</a>\n			<style>\n@media only screen and (max-width: 1023px){\n    .text-image br{\n        display: none;\n    }\n}\n@media only screen and (max-width: 767px){\n    .text-image img{\n        width: 25px;\n}\n}\n</style>','Dowell Data Cube','','publish','closed','closed','','dowell-data-cube','','','2024-04-15 01:18:24','2024-04-15 01:18:24','',0,'http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/?page_id=379',0,'page','',0);
