h2>		\n			<h2>Dowell Ux Living Lab</h2>		\n			<h2>Services</h2>		\n			<h2>WordPress</h2>		\n			<h2>Project</h2>		\n			<h2>Dynamic</h2>		\n			<h2>Description</h2>		\n		<p>Dowell Data Cube is a dynamic website showcasing the features of the Dowell DataCube and its API. Built on WordPress, the site utilizes the Elementor plugin to create a modern and visually appealing layout.</p>		\n			<h2>Elementor and Yoast</h2>		\n		<ul><li>Utilizes Elementor plugin in WordPress for modern website layout and design.</li><li>Elementor\'s drag-and-drop interface used to create visually appealing pages.</li><li>Implemented responsive design elements for optimal viewing on all devices.</li><li>Integrated custom widgets and elements for unique page layouts.</li><li>Utilized Elementor\'s theme builder for consistent branding across the site.</li><li>Employed advanced styling options for enhanced visual appeal.</li><li>Optimized website speed and performance through Elementor\'s optimization features.</li><li>Incorporated SEO-friendly page modules for better search engine visibility.</li><li>Utilized Elementor\'s dynamic content capabilities for automatic updates.</li><li>Implemented Elementor\'s form builder for user engagement and data collection</li></ul>		\n			<a href=\"https://www.samanta.tech/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Visit Website\n					</a>\n			<style>\n@media only screen and (max-width: 1023px){\n    .text-image br{\n        display: none;\n    }\n}\n@media only screen and (max-width: 767px){\n    .text-image img{\n        width: 25px;\n}\n}\n</style>','Dowell Data Cube','','inherit','closed','closed','','379-revision-v1','','','2024-04-14 06:16:43','2024-04-14 06:16:43','',379,'http://afaq-waheed-portfolio.local/?p=384',0,'revision','',0);
